<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to the ARVYNO Private Club</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f6;
      color: #18181b;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 35px 15px;
    }
    .wrapper {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e4e4e7;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 36px 24px 20px 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f1f4;
    }
    .logo-img {
      max-height: 65px;
      width: auto;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .brand-subtitle {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 2.5px;
      color: #92722a;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 28px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #18181b;
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }
    .body-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #52525b;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    }
    .highlight-card {
      background-color: #faf8f5;
      border: 1px solid #e8dfd1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .highlight-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      color: #92722a;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }
    .perks-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: #3f3f46;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }
    .btn-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0 10px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 13px 32px;
      background: #18181b;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #fafafa;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #f1f1f4;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #71717a;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #92722a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="https://www.arvynobd.com/images/logo/arvyno-logo.png" alt="ARVYNO" class="logo-img" />
      <p class="brand-subtitle">Private Club Newsletter</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <h2 class="greeting">Welcome to the ARVYNO Private Club</h2>
      <p class="body-text">
        Thank you for subscribing. You have gained private access to our sartorial releases, seasonal collections, and limited edition drops before they are revealed to the public.
      </p>

      <div class="highlight-card">
        <div class="highlight-title">Your Member Privileges</div>
        <ul class="perks-list">
          <li><strong>Early Access Drops:</strong> 24-hour priority window for heavyweight tees &amp; tailored releases.</li>
          <li><strong>Private Atelier Archive:</strong> Secret seasonal sales and limited restock alerts.</li>
          <li><strong>Behind the Craft:</strong> Exclusive look into our combed cotton engineering &amp; design atelier.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="body-text">
        We promise zero spam. Only curated sartorial drops and refined luxury updates.
      </p>

      <div class="btn-container">
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.arvynobd.com/products">Explore Collections</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <strong>ARVYNO</strong> &bull; Luxury Apparel &amp; Sartorial Essentials<br />
      House-50, Block-F, Road-2, Eastern Housing, Pallabi, Dhaka, Bangladesh, 1216<br />
      Hotline: <a href="tel:+8801886957897">+880 1886-957897</a> &bull; Web: <a href="https://www.arvynobd.com" target="_blank">www.arvynobd.com</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
